Subject: [PATCH] m21s: gate recovery init events

The F415F recovery rc is parsed together with vendor init files during a
normal Android boot.  Its debug/USB actions are recovery-only and are rejected
by Android 17 SELinux, so keep them behind the recovery boot mode.

--- a/etc/init/init.recovery.exynos9611.rc
+++ b/etc/init/init.recovery.exynos9611.rc
@@ -1,10 +1,10 @@
-on init
+on init && property:ro.bootmode=recovery
     write /proc/sys/kernel/hung_task_timeout_secs 0
 
-on late-init
+on late-init && property:ro.bootmode=recovery
     setprop ro.debuggable 1
     setprop service.adb.root 1
     setprop sys.usb.configfs 1
     setprop sys.usb.config adb
 
-on boot
+on boot && property:ro.bootmode=recovery
